# Immich Docker project

Infrastructure-only repo. Read `AGENTS.md` then `docs/STATE.md` before edits.

## Must not

- Mount `config/immich.json` or set `IMMICH_CONFIG_FILE` (locks Admin UI; caused freezes)
- Use `ghcr.io/razgrizhsu/immich-deduper` (use `razgrizhsu/immich-deduper` on Docker Hub)
- Add healthchecks with `curl` to port 3001 or wrong paths
- Hardcode `D:\...` paths in compose (use `.env` vars)
- Read or modify `library/`, `dedup-data/` unless task requires it
- Enable GPU/ROCm/OpenVINO WSL for ML without explicit user request and hardware proof

## Must

- Keep Postgres `database` on networks `default` and `immich-deduper`
- Use `CHOKIDAR_USEPOLLING=true` on `immich-server` (Windows)
- Keep `MACHINE_LEARNING_REQUEST_THREADS=8` in `.env.example`
- Update `docs/STATE.md` after behavior-changing changes
- Use `docker compose stop -t 120` for graceful shutdown docs/commands

## Files to edit for infra changes

`docker-compose.yml`, `.env.example`, `docs/*`, `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`
